yunohost (12.1.41.45) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: wire the resident daemon's automatic contribution setting.
    - migrate contribution settings storage from a standalone
      contribution.toml into the agent's own config.json (a "contribution"
      block matching Go's ContributionFileConfig), so auto_submit changes
      reach the daemon on restart.
  * nostr-api: allow writes under /etc and /var/lib/nostrhost-agent so
    agent settings saves (contribution config, hf_token, llm.env, the
    agent's config.json) no longer fail with "Read-only file system".
  * api: fix 500 on GET /package/agent/export/list by wrapping the bare
    list as {"cycles": [...]} (Bottle only auto-serialises top-level
    dicts).

yunohost (12.1.41.44) stable; urgency=low

  * nostrhost: native API for agent model management and HF contribution.
    - model profile/recommend/download/select (drives the local inference
      runtime download + systemd unit + agent config inference block),
